          "payload": "tree ed968e602c80ce674fbafb1fca012ca0c182a7c7\nparent afd8bd70733c38487f50241cb44b2bcd10ccab4c\nauthor msucharda <Suchardamartin@gmail.com> 1792664795 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792664795 +0200\n\nSend release asset upload body as binary byte[] (#78)\n\nAn if expression enumerated the byte[] body into object[], which\nInvoke-WebRequest sent as text of decimal byte values, so GitHub\nreported a different digest and the release stayed a draft.\n\nThe test stub now hashes what Invoke-WebRequest would actually send,\nand new tests check the upload body type and content and that a draft\nof another tag is left untouched.\n\nPart of #16\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
